                "text": "New Jersey lost 12k jobs in May and June. The labor market is crashing, prices are rising, & hundreds of thousands of New Jerseyans are about to lose their healthcare.\n\n@Jack4NJ, how many more chances does your boss get before you start to put hardworking Jersey families first? https://t.co/TTjOtId3LE",
