                "text": "If you\u2019re one of the 500,000+ New Jerseyans who gets health insurance through Get Covered NJ, your premium is about to explode because of the Republican spending bill that @Jack4NJ wholeheartedly endorsed.\n\nJack Ciattarelli is already costing you.\n\nhttps://t.co/Vj1mmk2Vey",
