                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was really disappointed to miss the Veterans Business Summit while in DC voting against cuts to healthcare and other services.\n\nThank you to Senator @VinGopal and my husband, Jason, a fellow Navy veteran, for going in my stead and talking about my plans to protect veterans from cuts to services and to make it easier to start and grow a small business.",
