                "retweet_count": 68,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump and the Republican majorities in Congress had a choice between:\na) shutting the government down\nb) working with Democrats to lower costs and prevent health insurance premiums from skyrocketing.\n\nGuess which one they chose? This is precisely the extreme MAGA agenda that @Jack4NJ wants to bring to NJ.",
