                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 36,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Unlike Jack, I don\u2019t just talk a big game \u2014 I deliver. From utilities, to healthcare, to housing, I know how to make New Jersey a better place for every family, and I\u2019ve got a record to prove it.",
