                "reply_count": 20,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Trump administration\u2019s Medicaid cuts are going to make our communities sicker, and ultimately cost us more. I\u2019ll take on Trump and a healthcare system that\u2019s not working for anyone to bring money back and deliver care in innovative ways.",
