                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Between supporting Trump\u2019s price hike bill and putting a 10% sales tax on the table, @Jack4NJ has proven to New Jerseyans time and time again that a vote for him means higher healthcare prices, utility costs, and barriers to opportunity. He\u2019s shown us that New Jersey can\u2019t afford him.\nhttps://t.co/T1QZv3oiWW",
