                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "New Jersey \u2014 I\u2019ll fight like hell to make sure utility, housing, and healthcare bills are affordable for your family. \n\nAs governor, my job is to bring opportunity into our state and give you and your kids a better life.",
