                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday in East Brunswick, we brought together members of our transition action teams, task force, and local elected officials for a policy summit to collaborate on solutions to the issues facing our state from healthcare to transportation to utility costs. I am truly grateful to all the public servants, experts, and stakeholders who are volunteering their time, skills, and expertise to make life easier and more affordable here in the Garden State.",
