                "retweet_count": 39,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I am announcing my nomination of Dr. Stephen Cha to be the next Commissioner of the Department of Human Services. \n\nDr. Cha was previously a senior leader at the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services, and has deep experience on major policy issues like Medicaid and maternal health. He's also helped the federal government navigate public health crises and will be ready to go on Day One to ensure that New Jersey is well equipped to navigate and protect against Washington\u2019s attacks on healthcare. \n\nI look forward to getting to work with Dr. Cha on these issues on our mission to deliver for you, New Jersey.",
